---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="China AI Hub does not use tracking cookies. This page explains the technical cookies from our hosting provider."
  type="article"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: 2026-09-27</p>

    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>China AI Hub does not set tracking, analytics, or advertising cookies.</strong>
      We run no Google Analytics, no Meta Pixel, no Hotjar/Clarity, and no ad networks.
    </p>

    <h2>Technical cookies from our hosting provider</h2>
    <p>
      The site is served by Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may set strictly necessary technical
      measures at the infrastructure level, for example:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Bot management / security</strong> — Cloudflare may set a security token (e.g. <code>__cf_bm</code>) to distinguish humans from bots during the loading of protected resources.</li>
      <li><strong>Email protection</strong> — our contact email link is obfuscated by Cloudflare's email-protection feature, which runs a small script to decode the address in your browser. It does not track you.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      These technical cookies are used to keep the site operational and secure, not to profile
      visitors, serve ads, or build marketing audiences.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do NOT use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No first-party analytics cookies</li>
      <li>No advertising or retargeting cookies</li>
      <li>No social-media tracking pixels</li>
      <li>No consent-management banners are needed, because we set no optional cookies</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
    <p>
      You can clear or block cookies in your browser settings at any time. Blocking cookies does
      not affect your ability to read this site, which is a static website with no accounts or
      personalized features.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Martin.W — <a href="mailto:admin@sinoaihub.com">admin@sinoaihub.com</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
